<Site title="About — MooonStoreClinic"><section class="wrap prose section"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE SERVICE</p><h1>Independent support.<br/>Focused on your storefront.</h1><p class="lede">MooonStoreClinic is an independent service led by Mooon, helping online store operators examine product-page clarity and the next purchase step.</p><h2>Start with something specific.</h2><p>We begin with one page and an agreed goal. Shopify is the initial focus; product categories can vary. The service is in its introductory stage, and our published sample is demonstration work rather than a client case study.</p><h2>Evidence before promises.</h2><p>Confirmed issues, improvement ideas and unknowns are separated. An attractive mockup is not proof of a conversion lift. Work is accepted against agreed deliverables.</p><h2>Built around clear boundaries.</h2><p>Reviews and implementation are separate scopes. Live changes require agreed access, a preview, approval and a recovery plan.</p><a class="button" href="/sample/">See the sample report →</a></section></Site>